sentences.text:
The Petitioners have filed the present writ petition inter alia with the following prayer:-
"The petitioner, therefore fervently prays that your Lordship may graciously be pleased to admit this writ application and after hearing the counsel for the parties,
issue a writ in the nature of mandamus or any other writ directing the opp. Party No.
3 to give appointment to the petitioner No. 2 in the post of Peon lying vacant in the Kumarpur High School since 31.03.1997;
And/or further may be pleased to direct the opposite party NO. 1 to give adequate compensation to the petitioner under Land Acquisition Act, 1894 as their homestead land have been used for the establishment of the school;
And /or for this act of kindness, the petitioners shall as in duty bound, ever pray."
